      "options": {
       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><body><div style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #d4af37; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; max-width: 800px; margin: auto; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222;\">\r\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 28px; color: #000000; text-align: center; margin-top: 0;\">Northern Colorado Seller Strategy Guide</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;\">Thinking of selling your home in 2025? This exclusive guide from top Northern Colorado listing agent Christine Gwinnup will help you understand what truly impacts your bottom line&mdash;so you can sell smarter, faster, and with confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 20px; padding-left: 24px;\">\r\n\t<li>How to price your home to attract the right buyers</li>\r\n\t<li>What prep steps and upgrades actually add value</li>\r\n\t<li>Marketing and negotiation strategies that work</li>\r\n\t<li>Access to a proven checklist used by 39 sellers in 2024</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;\">Enter your information below to get instant access to the guide.</p>\r\n</div></body></html>\n"
